  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your blows land at just the right moment to hit hardest.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Lucky Strike<sup>ARG</sup>.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When you spend a use of adaptive luck to use this feat, you may roll twice and select the better result on all weapon damage rolls until the beginning of your next turn. In addition, you may expend one use of mythic power to cause a single weapon damage roll to deal maximum damage without needing to roll.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-combat-a-m-feats#toc213\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
